{
  "title": "Text import's 60 s AI timeout leaves no headroom under the clients' 60 s",
  "description": "EXTRACTION_TIMEOUT_SECS (ramekin-core/src/ai/config.rs) lets an extraction call take 60 s, and text import waits on it in the request. \
The iOS client uses URLSession's default 60 s request timeout, and the web client's limit is also 60 s. So a slow but valid extraction can make the client give up before the server parses, enriches and responds. \
PR #755 hit the same problem for photo generation and set IMAGE_TIMEOUT_SECS to 45 s. Either lower the extraction floor (claude-sonnet-5.5 takes 10-20 s a recipe, per data/ai-evals/text-extraction.md) or give the clients a longer timeout for import requests, on both web and iOS.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "bug",
  "labels": [
    "ai",
    "api",
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-10-04T20:40:00-07:00",
